{"availability":"available","full":"ZCodium-project/ZCodium","name":"ZCodium","description":"ZCodium，Independent audit fork of ZCode (ZCode → ZCodium). All monitoring and telemetry removed; upstream commits reviewed one by one. ZCode 的独立审计分支（ZCode → ZCodium）：已移除监控与遥测，上游改动逐提交审阅。","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":221,"forks":11,"created":"2026-09-23T21:53:06Z","updated":"2026-10-07T12:04:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zcodium-project.github.io/","topics":["ai-agents","vibe-coding","zcod","zcode","zcode-desktop","zcodium"],"demo":"https://zcodium-project.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:45.687Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:45.687Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:45.687Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:18.107Z","stars":218,"forks":11},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:45.687Z","stars":221,"forks":11}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository is forked from zai-org/ZCode, open-sourced by Zhipu on September 21, 2026. The name follows the same pattern as Chrome → Chromium and VS Code → VSCodium: ZCode → ZCodium. Everything here is backed by code and reproducible checks."],"features":["ZCodium keeps the product itself — an AI coding workspace for desktop, browser and terminal — and rebuilds it from the public source with monitoring and telemetry removed and vendor services off by default.","One Agent, three interfaces: the Electron desktop app, the browser workspace and the zcodium terminal TUI share the same Agent runtime and sessions; you can also connect to a remote host over SSH, or drive the same…","Plans, edits, runs, verifies: file changes arrive as diffs, terminal commands carry their context, the agent checks its own work by running commands and tests, and a built-in browser plugin drives a real browser for web…","Asks before it touches your project: every edit, command and tool call can require approval — allow o